@startuml
!theme plain
|a_default| Default
|a_default|
start
:Start ONS Bootstrapping process;
:Is input a URN?;
:v1: Is input a URN? ({Yes, No}); <<objectSignal>>
if () then ([v1 = 'Yes'])
:Resolve URN to domain-name;
else ([v1 = 'No'])
:If input is URL, continue;
endif
:Check input type again;
:v2: Second check decision ({Loop, Proceed}); <<objectSignal>>
if () then ([v2 = 'Proceed'])
:Once we have resolved the URN to a domain-name, we send a DNS query;
:Get list of URLs from DNS query;
:Link to designated DS;
:End of process;
stop
endif
@enduml